Options -Indexes

# HTTP Basic Auth — gates every request (including GET) at the web-server
# level, before PHP even runs. AuthUserFile must be an ABSOLUTE path and
# must match wherever this project actually lives on THIS server — update
# it if you move/redeploy the project to a different path or host.
# AuthType Basic
AuthName "Quill"
# AuthUserFile /home/yourusername/rss/.htpasswd
# Require valid-user
